    "one_liner": "Compressed 12-hour RN shift: triage tasks, ace clinical mini-games, stay on schedule — or overtime / miss the critical moment.",
    "mvp_scope": "Multi-patient accelerated shift with slots, windows, chart history (past hx), panel swap on patient change, hourly check-doctor-orders (expire end of hour), thin dynamic/urgent spawn + game-time emergencies + thin deterioration, score + final outcome (tasks + satisfaction/status), one scenario pack, thin challenge gate, prioritization debrief, fiction disclaimer — CSS motion first; no auth/chaos/full acuity/class-interaction math",
    "main_constraints": "Vanilla JS ES6 modules (+ jQuery/signals or light reactive layer); no React/Ink/Twine unless approved; military game clock; panels over floating windows; no auth/friends until Later epic; declarative modular architecture (game-config + game-state actions/subscribe + task-system processors; no liveQuery task activation)",
